{"id":"H7940","lemma":"שָׂכָר","transliteration":"sakhar","sayIt":"sa-KHAR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Sachar","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.26.4;\nson of: Obed-edom (H5654);\nbrother of: Shemaiah (H8098I), Jehozabad (H3075H), Joah (H3098I), Nethanel (H5417K), Ammiel (H5988I), Issachar (H3485H) and Peullethai (H6469)\n§ Sacar = \"wages\"\n1) father of Ahiam, one of David's mighty warriors\n2) a Korahite Levite gatekeeper, the 4th son of Obed-edom in the time of David","glosses":["sachar"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-11","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Sachar","kjv":"of Sacar"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"Sachar","kjv":"and Sacar"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 11:35","note":"Ahiam the son of Sacar the Hararite, Eliphal the son of Ur,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H8325","lemma":"שָׁרָר","transliteration":"sharar","gloss":"Sharar"},{"id":"H3075","lemma":"יְהוֹזָבָד","transliteration":"yehozavad","gloss":"Jehozabad"},{"id":"H3098","lemma":"יוֹאָח","transliteration":"yoach","gloss":"Joah"},{"id":"H3485","lemma":"יִשָּׂשכָר","transliteration":"yissaskhar","gloss":"Issachar"},{"id":"H5417","lemma":"נְתַנְאֵל","transliteration":"netanel","gloss":"Nethanel"},{"id":"H5654","lemma":"עֹבֵד אֱדוֹם","transliteration":"oved edom","gloss":"Obed-edom"},{"id":"H5988","lemma":"עַמִּיאֵל","transliteration":"ammiel","gloss":"Ammiel"},{"id":"H6469","lemma":"פְּעֻלְּתַי","transliteration":"peulltay","gloss":"Peullethai"}],"senses":[{"id":"H7940H","gloss":"Sachar","relation":"H7940H = a Name of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}